+## Features compiled out on macOS
+
+| feature | reason |
+|---|---|
+| `IScriptable.Clone()` / `ISerializable.Clone()` | ISerializable::Clone not found; returns null |
+| `VisualControllerComponent.LoadAppearanceDependencies` | VisualController::LoadDependencies not identified; returns false |
+| `inkSystem.GetWorldWidgets` | inkWorldLayer layout differs; returns empty |
+| `MappinSystem.GetPoiMappinPhase` (internal; OpenWorldSystem activity state) | getter not identified; reports Invalid, so activities are treated as not completed |
+
+Reduced scope: `Component/Toggle` only reports toggles made from scripts (the native Toggle is inlined).
+
+## Non-ABI platform changes
+
+Clipboard and keyboard character mapping (`src/App/Platform/*.mm`), `ScriptBundle` size 0x178 (pthread mutex),
+`std::hash<EntityID>`, hopscotch containers in `lib/Core/Stl.hpp`, and the RuntimeProvider image depth for the .app.
+The remaining `HMODULE`, `wchar_t` and Win32 uses are inside `#if defined(_WIN32)` blocks or are portable
